[/^当前载入 (\d+) 条历史渠道记录，其中 (\d+) 条明确登记为当前构建；其余不自动归入本轮测试。$/,'$1 historical channel records loaded; $2 are explicitly logged on the current build. The rest are not counted in this round.'],
[/^可查的记录 · (\d+) 条$/,'Searchable records · $1'],[/^有精确次数 (\d+) 条$/,'Exact call count · $1'],[/^模型调用 (\d+) 次$/,'Model calls · $1'],[/^次数未知 (\d+) 条$/,'Count unknown · $1'],[/^采用模型正文 (\d+) 条$/,'Model text adopted · $1'],
[/^(.+) \/ (\d+) 次 ↗$/,'$1 / $2 call(s) ↗'],[/^(\d+) 条 ↗$/,'$1 ↗'],
[/^(SYN-\d+) · (\S+) · (\S+?)岁? · (\S+)$/,(m,id,t,a,h)=>[id,SYN[t]||t,SYN[a+'岁']||SYN[a]||a.replace('岁',''),SYN[h]||h].join(' · ')],
[/^仅用于需求梳理与软件测试，不是保险条款、承保规则或独立验证样本。\s*访问职责：(.+)$/,(m,r)=>'For needs exploration and software testing only; not clause wording, underwriting rules or independent validation samples. Roles: '+r.replace('营销展业','Sales').replace('客户自助','Self-service').replace(/、/g,', ')]
